  "rules": [
    "Text may not contain < > { } or line breaks.",
    "The hero always makes the same pie: a hand-stretched base, a tomato spiral, torn mozzarella, salami cups and basil, baked 90 seconds in a wood-fired oven at 485 °C. hero.stages are its seven captions, in order: dough ball, stretch, sauce, toppings, into the oven, bake, out.",
    "menu.pies: each pie is drawn from its toppings: 1-4 kinds from mozz, provola, salame, basil, nduja, friar (friarielli/greens), mush, olive, burrata (count 1), garlic, sausage, morta (mortadella/ham), with a count each (1-14). finish adds oregano, oil, parm (grated cheese), honey, pist (pistachio). base is rossa (tomato) or bianca (no tomato); veg marks vegetarian pies.",
    "build.toppings: 3-9 builder toppings, each a different kind, with the price of one portion.",
    "hours: Sunday to Saturday, null = closed, on the quarter hour; pickup slots run from 15 minutes after opening to 15 minutes before closing."
